# Environment — the active `.env` is a derived/local file (copied from one of
# the per-env files below by the android:*/ios:*/start:* scripts), never commit
# it. The per-env files themselves only hold a non-secret API URL, so they ARE
# committed (same as frontend).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

